<name>Psu-143364 Family Map — Inocalla holdings</name>
<description>Master map of the Inocalla family parcels on and around Plan Psu-143364, Paracale / Jose Panganiban, Camarines Norte. Every polygon here is plotted from a validated technical description (traverse closure and area checked) anchored to the official BLBM No. 1 Batobalani monument. Grows one parcel at a time as sibling titles are transcribed and validated. Started 2026-09-22. PENDING SLOTS (awaiting clean title photos or SMD certified plan): Lot 5 (Casper Inocalla, 23.5845 has, adjoins Lot 4 west), Lot 1 (across the creek NW), Lot 3 Amd. (7.3513 has), Lot 6 (Vicente Inocalla), Lots 1/7/8 Amd. (P-1615 / P-1516 / P-1617), T-20755/T-4695 (11.1495 has), T-20757 (Lot 5, Psu-143363).</description>
<Style id="lot4"><LineStyle><color>ff00ff00</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>3300ff00</color></PolyStyle></Style>
<Style id="vicente"><LineStyle><color>ffff8800</color><width>2.5</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>22ff8800</color></PolyStyle></Style>
<Style id="mon"><IconStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><scale>1.3</scale></IconStyle></Style>
